<div class="section intro" id="try-it">
	<div class="diamond first" data-viewport-movement-perc="40" data-direction="-1"></div>
	<div class="content">
		<div class="headlines text">
			<h1>From store link<div>to <span class="highlight">ROAS</span>, easy!</div></h1>
			<p class="subheadline"><b><span class="rainbow"><b><span class="nowrap">You provide a link.</span> <span class="nowrap">We deliver creatives.</span> <span class="nowrap">We test them.</span> <span class="nowrap">You profit.</span></b></span> <br />Sounds good? Start your journey!</b></p>
		</div>
		<div class="getfreecreatives">
	<div class="inside">
		<div class="pre-input movable">
			<form class="app-searchable" method="POST" id="get-free-creatives" action="https://adspawn.io/get-free-creatives">
				<div class="inputwrap">
					<span class="inputborder">
						<input data-endpoint="https://adspawn.io/search-app"  class="storelink light app-search-input" type="text" autocomplete="off" name="storelink" id="storelink" placeholder="Search for a game or paste a store link">
					</span>
					<div class="stores">
						<img src="https://adspawn.io/img/appstore.svg" alt="App Store" class="store appstore" />
						<img src="https://adspawn.io/img/googleplay.svg" alt="Google Play" class="store googleplay" />
					</div>
					<div class="app-search-list softshadow">
	<div class="status">
		<span class="searching"><img src="https://adspawn.io/img/loading-dark.svg" class="loading-image" /><span class="text">Searching...</span></span>
		<span class="noresults">Couldn&#039;t find the app, try pasting the app&#039;s store link directly!</span>
		<span class="error">We&#039;re having store search connection issues, please paste the app&#039;s store link directly.</span>
	</div>
	<ul class="apps"></ul>
	<div class="findhint">Can&#039;t find your app? Try pasting the app&#039;s store link directly.</div>
</div>				</div>
				<button class="pink" type="submit"><span>GRAB </span><b class="strong">FREE CREATIVES</b></button>
			</form>
		</div>
		<div class="enter-email childmovable away incoming">
			<div class="selected-storelink">
				<div class="appimg movable"><img src="" /></div>
				<p class="appname movable"><span></span></p>
			</div>
			<h2 class="title movable">Creatives <span class="highlight">are in the queue</span> <br class="hidemobile"/>and you will get them very soon!</h2>
			<p class="movable">Where do you want us to send them?</p>
			<form class="movable" method="POST" id="get-free-creatives-email" action="https://adspawn.io/get-free-creatives">
				<div class="inputborder">
					<input class="email light" type="text" name="email" id="email" placeholder="Your work e-mail address">
				</div>
				<button class="pink" type="submit">Confirm</button>
			</form>
			<img class="precache" src="https://adspawn.io/img/platform-demo.png" alt="Platform" />
		</div>
		<div class="post-email childmovable away incoming">
			<h2 class="title movable">Feeling <span class="highlight">creative</span>?</h2>
			<p class="movable">Create your own ads in AdSpawn Platform!</p>
			<div class="platform-demo movable">
				<div class="topborder"></div>
				<img src="https://adspawn.io/img/platform-demo.png" alt="Platform" />
				<a id="jumpstart" class="btn pink" href="https://adspawn.io/register?intent=afterfreerequest"><span>Use adspawn</span><span class="external-circle"></span></a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>	</div>
