<div class="section how" id="how-it-works">
	<div class="content">
		<h2>How it works</h2>
	</div>
	<ol class="steps">
	 
		<li class="step0">
						<h3 class="title iconed">Paste a link</h3>
						<p>Simple as that! We automatically analyze your mobile game and get all of your publicly available data, including gameplay.</p>
		</li>
	 
		<li class="step1">
						<h3 class="title iconed">Research &amp; ideation</h3>
						<p>Doing market research and generating the best ideas based on industry trends and years of experience.</p>
		</li>
	 
		<li class="step2">
						<h3 class="title"><span class="gradientcontainer smallobject softcorner"><span class="ico"></span></span>Next-gen creative production</h3>
						<p>You don't need to provide any assets! Your batch of static and video creatives are in the making.</p>
		</li>
	 
		<li class="step3">
						<h3 class="title iconed">Testing and ROAS optimization</h3>
						<p>Testing and performance analysis to iterate with new strategies and assets to maximize results.</p>
		</li>
		</ol>
</div>

<div class="section revenue" id="advantages">
	<div class="diamonds">
		<div class="diamond first" data-viewport-movement-perc="18" data-direction="-1"></div>
		<div class="diamond second" data-viewport-movement-perc="40" data-direction="1"></div>
	</div>
	<div class="content">
		<h2>AdSpawn <span class="highlight">supercharges</span> <br class="hidemobile" />internal marketing teams</h2>
		
		<p class="based">Q1 2025 data from Post Apo Tycoon case study.</p>
		<div class="casewrap halves stretched">
			<div class="half left">
				<img src="https://adspawn.io/img/post-apo-case-study.png" alt="Post Apo Tycoon AdSpawn creatives" />
			</div>
			<div class="half left">
				<ul class="results">
					<li><span class="highlight">25 million</span><span class="rest"> impressions</span></li>
					<li><span class="highlight">3 new</span><span class="rest"> creative winners</span></li>
					<li><span class="highlight">44&percnt;</span><span class="rest"> lower CPI</span></li>
					<li><span class="highlight">90&percnt;</span><span class="rest"> less budget spent on creative production</span></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="advantages">
			<div class="halves cards stretched">
			 
				<div class="half item advantage0">
					<div class="card">
						<h3 class="title iconed">Save time &amp; money</h3>
						<p>Minimize budget and reduce hours spent on market research, ASO keywords research and copywriting.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			 
				<div class="half item advantage1">
					<div class="card">
						<h3 class="title iconed">Evolving AI&nbsp;technology</h3>
						<p>Our AI platform is continuously self-developing and adjusting to the latest market trends.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			 
				<div class="half item advantage2">
					<div class="card">
						<h3 class="title iconed">Increase brand awareness</h3>
						<p>Output tailored specifically for your game, designed to enhance its recognition and elevate it above the competitors.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			 
				<div class="half item advantage3">
					<div class="card">
						<h3 class="title iconed">Crafted by UA &amp; creative experts</h3>
						<p>AdSpawn has been developed by professionals with years of experience in advertising mobile games of all genres.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
						</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>



<div class="section about-us" id="about-us">
	<div class="content">
		<h2>Team</h2>
		<p class="description">Four gamers with different marketing backgrounds decided to take mobile games marketing to the next level with the power of AI. We built AdSpawn on years of experience from working on hundreds of mobile games.</p>
		
		<ul class="people">
			<li class="person">
				<img class="photo" src="https://adspawn.io/img/people/milan.jpg">
				<p class="name">Milan Strba</p>
				<p class="position">CEO</p>
				<p class="about">Data obsessed performance marketer experienced in scaling over 60 mobile games. Loves to play games on hardest difficulty when not exercising irl.</p>
				<div class="stats card">
					<ul class="skills">
						<li class="skill">
							<div class="label">User Acquisition</div>
							<div class="rating"><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span></div>
						</li>
						<li class="skill">
							<div class="label">ASO</div>
							<div class="rating"><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span></div>
						</li>
						<li class="skill">
							<div class="label">Sales</div>
							<div class="rating"><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span></div>
						</li>
						<li class="skill">
							<div class="label">Running</div>
							<div class="rating"><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span></div>
						</li>
					</ul>
					<ul class="textual">
						<li class="group">
							<div class="label">AI focus</div>
