							<div class="value"><span class="icon game"></span> Elden Ring</div>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</li>
			
			<li class="person">
				<img class="photo" src="https://adspawn.io/img/people/martin.jpg">
				<p class="name">Martin Luther</p>
				<p class="position">CMO</p>
				<p class="about">Always on track with the latest pop culture trends. Cannot stop thinking about creative marketing. Free time spent on chill games OR intense multiplayer like NHL &amp; Rocket League.</p>
				<div class="stats card">
					<ul class="skills">
						<li class="skill">
							<div class="label">Idea Making</div>
							<div class="rating"><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span></div>
						</li>
						<li class="skill">
							<div class="label">Marketing</div>
							<div class="rating"><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span></div>
						</li>
						<li class="skill">
							<div class="label">Copywriting</div>
							<div class="rating"><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span><span class="star">&#x1F533;</span></div>
						</li>
