			</li>
			
			<li class="person">
				<img class="photo" src="https://adspawn.io/img/people/roman.jpg">
				<p class="name">Roman Janajev</p>
				<p class="position">CTO</p>
				<p class="about">A hacker by heart who can code anything given enough caffeine. Into AI before it was cool. Loves steaks &amp; onions. Plays obscure indie games that you&#039;ve probably never heard of.</p>
